<title>RUSSIA: Russian wage arrears rise in August.</title>
<headline>Russian wage arrears rise in August.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from the federal or regional governments rose to 6.11 trillion roubles on August 26 from 5.80 trillion roubles on July 22, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS	    Aug 26	  July 22</p>
<p>    wage arrears (government)	6,107	    5,799</p>
<p>    wage arrears (companies)	29,915	   28,151</p>
<p>    wage arrears (total)	    36,022	   33,950</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
